            <Description ?01M1RX2G3B4EWTBKCAYBJ671CT>
            检查所有选定闭包实际 import/manifest 环，清除兼容出口背后的剩余反向边；若环仍有真实未迁移职责则证据replan，不声称完成；保持旧名不触发无关迁移。
            </?01M1RX2G3B4EWTBKCAYBJ671CT>
            <TrackLink #enforce-runtime-closure-dependency-boundaries { state = "bound" project_ref = "host" }>
          )>
        ]>
      )>
      <TaskGroup #G6 { name = "整体语义等价验收" status = "DONE" order = 5 } (
        <SubNodes [
          <Task #G6-T0 { name = "纠正多 Actor Workflow 恢复基线偏差" status = "DONE" order = 0 } (
            <Description ?01M1RYK20HPHT7W3WTPA0H26ZC>
            诊断并修复基线 B1 的 transition head/session receipt 冲突；保留 fail-closed 与既有断言，不混入纯重构、不放大超时。
            </?01M1RYK20HPHT7W3WTPA0H26ZC>
